{'symbol': 'UPS', 'date': '2022-11-01 07:00:00', 'title': "UPS TURNS FRIDAY, NOVEMBER 4 ‘BROWN' WITH HIRING BLITZ TO FILL THOUSANDS OF SEASONAL JOBS", 'text': 'ATLANTA, NOV. 01, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- UPS (NYSE: UPS) SAID TODAY IT PLANS TO HIRE AT LEAST 60,000 OF THE 100,000+ SEASONAL EMPLOYEES IT NEEDS FOR THE HOLIDAY SEASON IN ONE WEEKEND. UPS BROWN FRIDAY BEGINS NOV. 4, WITH MORE THAN 450 IN-PERSON AND VIRTUAL EVENTS SCHEDULED ACROSS THE COUNTRY.'}